# App dependencies, pinned exactly for repeatability (Dependabot bumps them).
# requirements.txt is compiled from this file and pins everything they pull in.
# The image installs requirements.txt, not this file: after changing a line
# here, recompile it (the command is at the top of the Dockerfile). verify.yml
# fails if the two disagree. Every line is `name==version`.
